   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **November 2021 (Saturday)**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Lucky To Be Alive**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **In Color**: rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Thank You Too!**: back after 27 archived shows (1342 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2021-11-06.leary** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 153 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bedouine opened the set; attendees required proof of vaccination [1]\n- Reviewer considers this night their favorite among the three Chicago shows [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2021-11-06.leary**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Transferred from MP6 to iMac, tracked in Sound Studio, and encoded as FLAC [1]",
